# Pip Goes Out: a film in two parts on two sets (src/shared/cartoon/film_file.h `part`): each part has its own set, length, cast, shots and sound, and the
# parts play one after another as one film. The lines before the first part are the whole film's (and any others there would be every part's).
film    pip-goes-out
name    Pip Goes Out
about   Pip trots down the lantern path at dusk and comes out into a bright morning meadow, where it cheers at the day.
tags    character, dusk
still   13

part "The lantern path"
scene   film_assets/a-walk-at-dusk/set.pbrt
length  7
character  pip pip  at 0.3 0 3.8  facing 180
walk       pip  0.6 0.8   0.2 -0.6   1.2 -4.6
light   lantern  0 0   2.5 0   3.5 1   7 1
feel    pip  surprised 2.6 3.0 4.0 4.6
shot 0 Down the path
  key   2.0 1.0 -2.6   0.3 0.7 2.6   38
  key   1.6 0.9 -3.2   0.3 0.7 0.6   38
  subject pip
shot 4 The lantern lights
  key   -4.0 1.5 0.4   0.3 0.8 0.2   40
  key   -3.8 1.4 -0.8   0.3 0.8 -0.6   40
  subject pip

part "The meadow" fade 1.2
scene   film_assets/stage/set.pbrt
length  9
sky      9:30 10:00  south 180
ambience birds 0.7
scatter  grass 500 in -9 -12 9 4  scale 0.7 1.2  seed 3
place    tree  at -4.5 0 -7  scale 1.3
place    tree  at 5 0 -9  turn 40
place    bush  at 2.6 0 -3
place    rock  at -2 0 -1.5  scale 0.8
character  pip pip  at -3.2 0 2.2  facing 120
walk       pip  0.5 0.9   to 0.4 -1.0
feel       pip  happy 4.4 4.9
gesture    pip  "cheer" 5.4 6.0 7.4 8.0
say        pip  5.6 "What a day!"
shot 0 Into the sun
  key   2.8 1.1 4.6   -1.6 0.6 0.8   40
  key   2.4 1.0 3.2   -0.2 0.6 -0.6   40
  subject pip
shot 5 Cheering
  key   2.4 0.9 -3.0   0.4 0.65 -1.0   38
  subject pip
